3,Warlmanpa language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/warlmanpa_language,"Warlmanpa belongs to the Pama–Nyungan language family, the largest phylum of Australian Indigenous languages, and is specifically situated within the Ngumpin–Yapa subgroup.",Warlmanpa,Australian
