5,Warlmanpa - Sorosoro Sorosoro,https://www.sorosoro.org/en/warlmanpa/,"August 31, 2010 - Warlmanpa was not associated with either the Hanson or Lander River drainages. As such, it appears that Warlmanpa associations extended south to approximately level with the Davenport Ranges (Harvey ASEDA 802). ... The most recent Australian Bureau of Statistics 2006 Census estimated 48 speakers ...",Warlmanpa,Australian
