9,A Grammar of Warlmanpa,https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/98938,"February 26, 2025 - This volume also provides description of typologically notable features, including: a two-way stop contrast at each place of articulation; a complex second-position auxiliary system containing participant and tense/mood/aspect information; associated motion; and a lack of evidence for noun phrases. This volume lays the foundation for future Warlmanpa language work. https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/98938 · grammar; morphology; morphosyntax; Australian Aboriginal Languages; Grammatical Description",Warlmanpa,Australian
